  "notes": "{浮|う}く is an intransitive verb meaning to float or rise up.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{浮|う}かべる→浮かべる：13314_ukaberu⟧ (transitive, to set afloat)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {浮|う}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means 'is floating' (ongoing state)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{浮|う}く: to float on water\n- {浮|う}いた⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧: idle talk, rumors\n- ⟦{浮|う}き{沈|しず}み→浮き沈み：09611_ukishizumi⟧: ups and downs\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{浮|う}かぶ→浮かぶ：03916_ukabu⟧: to float, to come to mind",
